  50:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_directory_attributes_set.c **** /*    This function first attempts to find the specified directory.  If   */
  51:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_directory_attributes_set.c **** /*    found, the attribute set request is valid and the directory will    */
  52:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_directory_attributes_set.c **** /*    be modified with the new attributes.  Otherwise, if the directory   */
  53:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_directory_attributes_set.c **** /*    is not found, the appropriate error code is returned to the caller. */
  54:Middlewares/ST/filex/common/src/fx_directory_attributes_set.c **** /*                                                                        */
